==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Hyrule Bass}}
Hyrule Basses can be found in bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] on the [[Surface]]. They can also be bought from [[Nembis's Fine Goods]] and [[Lookout Landing#Mubs' General Store|Mubs' General Store]].{{Note|Only after three Main Quests related to "[[Regional Phenomena]]" have been completed.}}

