==Other Appearances==
==={{HWL|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[File:HWDE Hyrule Bass Food Icon.png|64px|left]]
In {{HWL}}, Hyrule Bass appear as [[Fish]]-type [[Food#Hyrule Warriors|Food]]. They are imbued with the [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] [[Element]]. When consumed by a [[Companion Fairy]] in the [[Dining Room]] of the [[My Fairy]] mode, Hyrule Bass can increase the Fairy's Trust level and personality traits.
